# Review

The title makes a contestable causal claim. It says that starting each session cold makes routing aids a permanent part of the system. An informed reader could argue that a stateless agent can reconstruct where to look in each session through search and inference from the material it finds, making explicit routing aids optional. The title's main verb asserts the disputed design consequence.
